PROCESSOR
---------
Use pdflatex. The package uses pdfTeX 3.141592653-2.6-1.40.29 features and
was verified to build with TeX Live 2026. Do NOT attempt latex (DVI) ->
ps2pdf; pdflatex must produce the final PDF directly.

BIBLIOGRAPHY
------------
references.bib is shipped; .bbl is NOT pre-generated. arXiv should run
bibtex (the natbib backend, plainnat style). The local verification used
BibTeX 0.99e from TeX Live 2026.

BUILD ORDER
-----------
pdflatex main.tex
bibtex main
pdflatex main.tex
pdflatex main.tex

A trailing \typeout line after \end{document} requests the 4-pass magic
to ensure cross-references resolve on arXiv's batch compiler.

CONTENTS
--------
main.tex          — paper source (single-file LaTeX article, plainnat
                     bibliography, hyperref [hidelinks,bookmarks=false],
                     listings + xcolor for code blocks, natbib).
references.bib    — 15-entry bibliography of arXiv help docs, ACM/SIGSOFT
                     guidance, and prior work on source-analysis methods.

There are NO figures and NO image files in this package.

IGNORE LISTS
------------
None. Every file in the tarball is required.

SPECIAL RESPONSES
-----------------
- "Hyperref Warning: Token not allowed in a PDF string": expected and
   non-fatal; hyperref is loaded with [hidelinks,bookmarks=false] precisely
   to minimise these.
- "Underfull/Overfull hbox": standard typesetting messages; ignore.

