PROVENANCE
----------
This source bundle was assembled through the 10-unit arxiv-prep-agent DAG
defined in arxiv-prep-agent-dag.toml of verivus-oss/agent-assurance-papers.
The publication evidence report records the local verification commands and
hashes outside the arXiv upload tarball. The pipeline run trail:
U01 snapshot → U02 filename audit → U03 junk strip → U04 bib hygiene →
U05 figure audit → U06 human review → U07 source-fix log → U08 4-pass
compile gate → U09 manifest + this 00README → U10 packaging.

The final local compile produced an 8-page, 211 700-byte PDF with SHA-256
b82e5c5ade164bb4df62d46180d86fc6c0296c863fc2b57e13ea129ca760bb2a; arXiv
should observe an equivalent PDF when running its own 4-pass pdflatex chain.
